    <string name="faq_title">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">How does payment work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">We exclusively support Cash on Delivery (COD) in Tunisian Dinars (TND). No bank card details are ever collected.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">What are the delivery times and fees?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Average delivery takes 25–35 minutes across Tunis. Standard delivery fees and minimum order amounts are displayed clearly before checkout.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">How do I track my order?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Open the Orders/Offers tab to view the real-time status timeline (Pending, Confirmed, Preparing, Ready, Out for delivery, Delivered).</string>

